    {
      "id": "claim_5a8ba284cab1422a9f17893c6b7a9ccd",
      "statement": "The core design principle of Facet is 'your API structure is your site structure' — placing a template at the expected URL path makes that endpoint serve HTML to browsers while continuing to return JSON to API clients.",
